 StyleBox[" ",
  FontSlant->"Italic"],
 "stands for the Wilson coefficient cG. The normalisation cg/4 arises from \
the form of the Feynman rules, cf. Table 1 in the draft. We set ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  FormBox[
   SubscriptBox["f", "a"], TraditionalForm]],
  FormatType->TraditionalForm,ExpressionUUID->
  "1703dbaa-9254-45bd-800e-33bc4d0b0e60"],
 " = 1 TeV. All limits will be on cg/fa."
}], "Text",
