Cell["\<\
Without the covariance matrix the data would favour a non-zero cG= 0.46. This \
is unphysical though because we rescaled the background with the k-factor.\
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.9688183283081083`*^9, 
  3.9688183885305634`*^9}},ExpressionUUID->"315d8988-65ae-403c-b30c-\
632d3752d81b"]
}, Open  ]],

